# SCSS Reference

## Critical
```scss
// ❌ NEVER:
font-size: 18px;
@media (min-width: 768px) {}
@include bp-down() {} OR @include bp-up() {}
// ✅ ALWAYS:
gap: rem-calc(16);           // Fixed values
font-size: fluid(16, 24);    // Responsive (min, max)
@media (width < $md) { }     // Desktop-first (smaller screens)
@media (width >= $md) { }    // Progressive enhancement (larger screens)
```

## Functions
```scss
rem-calc(16)              // → 1rem
fluid(16, 24)             // Responsive: 16px min, 24px max
fluid(16, 24, md, xl)     // Custom breakpoints
```

## Breakpoints
```scss
$sm: 576px;    $md: 768px;
$lg: 1024px;   $xl: 1200px;   $xxl: 1400px;
```

## Responsive Design

**Desktop-first approach** - Write desktop styles first, then adjust for smaller screens:

```scss
.component {
	// Desktop styles (default)
	grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
	gap: rem-calc(40);
	
	// Tablet
	@media (width < $lg) {
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
	}
	
	// Mobile
	@media (width < $md) {
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: rem-calc(24);
	}
}

// Progressive enhancement when needed
.header {
	display: block; // Mobile default
	
	@media (width >= $md) {
		display: flex; // Desktop enhancement
	}
}
```

## Exceptions
1px borders, box shadows, values under 4px
